## Document shape

The artifact is markdown. Frontmatter carries the decision; optional `##` sections carry the body. Choose a commit document for pending work or a skip document when no commit is needed.

- Commit document: frontmatter `type: commit` and `subject:`. Include `## Body` (one concise self-contained item) or the detailed `## Body Summary` / `## Body Details` / `## Body Footer` set, plus optional `## Files` and `## Excluded Files` (`path | reason`, where valid reasons are internal_ignore, not_task_related, sensitive, deferred).

```markdown
---
type: commit
subject: fix(auth): prevent token expiry race
---

## Body Summary
- [BS-1] Prevents a race where refreshed tokens could expire mid-request.

## Body Details
- [BD-1] The expiry check now happens after refresh; covers the concurrent-refresh edge case.

## Excluded Files
- [X-1] notes/todo.md | not_task_related
```

- Skip document when no commit is needed:

```markdown
---
type: skip
reason: Only generated artifacts changed; nothing to commit.
---
```

